{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aphrollo/aphrollo-tools/pulls/1202","id":4730921605,"node_id":"PR_kwDOS5lDhM8AAAABGfwihQ","html_url":"https://github.com/aphrollo/aphrollo-tools/pull/1202","diff_url":"https://github.com/aphrollo/aphrollo-tools/pull/1202.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/aphrollo/aphrollo-tools/pull/1202.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aphrollo/aphrollo-tools/issues/1202","number":1202,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Count first-run reds, queue reds and queue merges in stats","user":{"login":"harryberg1n","id":62075917,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyMDc1OTE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62075917?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryberg1n","html_url":"https://github.com/harryberg1n","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryberg1n/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryberg1n/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryberg1n/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryberg1n/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryberg1n/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryberg1n/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryberg1n/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryberg1n/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryberg1n/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"version: patch\n\n`aphrollo stats` printed \"first-run CI green 32/32 (100%), red by cause none\" and counted 118 allowed narrowed reruns as overrides (12 wrong blocks). Causes and fixes:\n\n- First-run reds never recorded: a push reads CI while it is pending, and a session that reads the red with gh and pushes a fix shows `workspace merge` only the green of the later head (#1186, #1192 have no ci event at all). `workspace merge` now reads the PR's run list and records the first head's conclusion at the run's own time (cause from the failed job); one call in `land`.\n- Merge-queue reds: a removal for `failed_checks` records a red ci event (`ci: queue`, cause `queue`); the fold turns a green lane red on it.\n- Speed: a PR queued without `--wait` got a `queued` event and never an ok one (the outside-merge scan treated the queued record as the verb's merge). Trunk taking the merge in now records the lane's merge ok.\n- Overrides: the old `override-bash-narrowed` events are an allowed rerun, not a waiver, and are no longer counted; one deny is at most one wrong block. `rerun-bash-narrowed` is no override (golden test).\n\nWriters touched outside internal/measure: internal/workspace merge.go (one call site), enqueue_await.go (one call), outsidemerge.go, cievent.go, firstrun.go (new). Historical log lines cannot be repaired; the numbers move for merges made from now on.\n","created_at":"2026-10-04T00:54:10Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T01:36:40Z","closed_at":"2026-10-04T01:36:38Z","merged_at":"2026-10-04T01:36:38Z","merge_commit_sha":"04543a7866274c78d08dbc0d52de9920b0f6f8ab","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aphrollo/aphrollo-tools/pulls/1202/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aphrollo/aphrollo-tools/pulls/1202/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aphrollo/aphrollo-tools/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aphrollo/aphrollo-tools/issues/1202/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aphrollo/aphrollo-tools/statuses/6e2087329a8fcdf466b3d73eddbed4bd1328ed2f","head":{"label":"aphrollo:lane/measure-fixes","ref":"lane/measure-fixes","sha":"6e2087329a8fcdf466b3d73eddbed4bd1328ed2f","user":{"login":"aphrollo","id":121213402,"node_id":"O_kgDOBzmR2g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121213402?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://